"Modes" = "Modes";
"**Newer** — copy files from the source whose modification date is newer than the destination's. Existing files only get replaced if they're truly newer." = "**Newer** — copy files from the source whose modification date is newer than the destination's. Existing files only get replaced if they're truly newer.";
"**Mirror** — make the destination an exact copy of the source. **Files at the destination that are not on the source are deleted.** This is destructive — FileFluss requires explicit confirmation." = "**Mirror** — make the destination an exact copy of the source. **Files at the destination that are not on the source are deleted.** This is destructive — FileFluss requires explicit confirmation.";
"**Additive** — only copy files that are missing on the destination. If a file already exists, the source is added next to it with a unique name. Nothing is overwritten or deleted." = "**Additive** — only copy files that are missing on the destination. If a file already exists, the source is added next to it with a unique name. Nothing is overwritten or deleted.";
"During sync, if a file with the same name exists on both sides but neither mode handles it cleanly, FileFluss asks per‑file how to resolve." = "During sync, if a file with the same name exists on both sides but neither mode handles it cleanly, FileFluss asks per‑file how to resolve.";
